Let \[f(x) = \begin{cases}
-x^2 - 1 &\text{if }x<0, \\
2&\text{if }0 \le x< 4, \\
\sqrt{x}&\text{if }x \ge 4.
\end{cases}
\]Find $f(\pi)$.

